    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata</code></a> implementation that inspects the given object for fields with the configured annotations\nand returns the field's values on calls to <a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>, <a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#getRevisionNumber()\"><code>getRevisionNumber()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个实现了 `<a href=\"RevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata</code></a>` 接口的类，它会检查给定对象中带有配置注解的字段，并在调用 `<a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>`、`<a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"#getRevisionNumber()\"><code>getRevisionNumber()</code></a>` 时返回这些字段的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
