      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a> of this change. If the <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a> cannot be determined, this method\nreturns <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html#UNKNOWN\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.UNKNOWN</code></a>.",
